                "id": "15753315"
              }
            ],
            "value": "It remains to be determined how SapM, once secreted into the phagosomal lumen, gains access to PI3P within the cytofacial membrane leaflet. It is possible that SapM is exported to the cytosolic side, or alternatively there may be a mechanism for PI3P presentation to SapM remaining on the luminal side"
